* A PostgreSQL replication slot retains WAL files until the primary runs out of disk space. How would you investigate and safely restore normal WAL cleanup?
* Replication lag increases after a large batch update, and the replica remains behind even after the batch completes. How would you investigate transaction size, replay conflicts, and replica capacity?
